 "text": "# Accordion\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Componentes\nHuman version (rendered examples): componentes/accordion.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\ncro-* / is-* classes in this page: cro-tree\n\nPainéis recolhíveis. No kit cada item vira uma pasta da árvore do jogo (aberta/fechada).\n\n## Exemplo\n\n```\n<div class=\"accordion\" id=\"acEx\" style=\"max-width:520px\">\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <h2 class=\"accordion-header\">\n      <button\n        class=\"accordion-button\"\n        type=\"button\"\n        data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n        data-bs-target=\"#acc1\"\n        aria-expanded=\"true\"\n        aria-controls=\"acc1\">\n        Equipamentos\n      </button>\n    </h2>\n    <div id=\"acc1\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#acEx\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">Espada, escudo e armadura.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <h2 class=\"accordion-header\">\n      <button\n        class=\"accordion-button collapsed\"\n        type=\"button\"\n        data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n        data-bs-target=\"#acc2\"\n        aria-expanded=\"false\"\n        aria-controls=\"acc2\">\n        Consumíveis\n      </button>\n    </h2>\n    <div id=\"acc2\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#acEx\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">Poções e asas.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <h2 class=\"accordion-header\">\n      <button\n        class=\"accordion-button collapsed\"\n        type=\"button\"\n        data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n        data-bs-target=\"#acc3\"\n        aria-expanded=\"false\"\n        aria-controls=\"acc3\">\n        Cartas\n      </button>\n    </h2>\n    <div id=\"acc3\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#acEx\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">Cartas de monstros.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Sempre aberto\n\nRemova data-bs-parent para que vários itens fiquem abertos ao mesmo tempo.\n\n## Nativo do kit: <details>\n\nO mesmo visual vale para o elemento HTML details, sem JavaScript:\n\n```\n<ul class=\"cro-tree\" role=\"tree\" style=\"max-width:300px\">\n  <li>\n    <details open>\n      <summary>Pasta aberta</summary>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Arquivo A</li>\n        <li>Arquivo B</li>\n      </ul>\n    </details>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <details>\n      <summary>Pasta fechada</summary>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Arquivo C</li>\n      </ul>\n    </details>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n## Flush\n\naccordion-flush remove bordas e cantos para encaixar o accordion em outro contêiner:\n\n```\n<div class=\"accordion accordion-flush\" id=\"acFl\" style=\"max-width:420px\">\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <h2 class=\"accordion-header\">\n      <button\n        class=\"accordion-button collapsed\"\n        type=\"button\"\n        data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n        data-bs-target=\"#acfl1\"\n        aria-expanded=\"false\">\n        accordion-flush\n      </button>\n    </h2>\n    <div id=\"acfl1\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#acFl\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">Sem bordas.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n« Validação · Alerts »\n",
